quadrupole.  If the predecessor outcome is `a`, prepare the six neighboring
contents around the prospective event site as

\[
 v_{-f}=r_{f,a},\qquad
 v_{+f}=2Ff+r_{f,a},\qquad
 v_n=Fn\quad(n\perp f).                               \tag{2}
\]

Pairwise cancellation gives the exact decoder

\[
 {1\over2}\sum_{n=\pm e_i}v_n n^T=F.                 \tag{3}
\]

The symbolic shell Jacobian has rank nine.  Equation (3) holds for every one
